{"title":"Idea bug调试方法","slug":"Idea-bug调试方法","date":"2025-09-29T01:55:18.000Z","updated":"2025-09-29T02:18:13.594Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Idea-bug调试方法.json","realPath":null,"excerpt":null,"covers":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"一、条件断点\"><a href=\"#一、条件断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、条件断点\"></a>一、条件断点</h1><p>1、传统方式  </p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 在循环里疯狂下一步</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (User user : userList) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// 低效！</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tSystem.out.println(user);</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (user.getName().equals(<span class=\"string\">&quot;目标用户&quot;</span>)) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"comment\">// 业务逻辑</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2、高级玩法：<code>右键断点-》设置条件（比如：user.getName().equals(&quot;目标用户&quot;)，它就会直接跳到满足条件的迭代）</code>。  </p>\n<h1 id=\"二、方法断点\"><a href=\"#二、方法断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、方法断点\"></a>二、方法断点</h1><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 在方法名上直接打断点，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 进入和退出都会暂停，超适合调试。</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@Transactional</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"title function_\">updateUser</span><span class=\"params\">(User user)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 在下面方法打断点，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 进入方法会暂停，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 退出方法也会暂停</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tuserMapper.save(user);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"三、字段断点\"><a href=\"#三、字段断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、字段断点\"></a>三、字段断点</h1><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 在下面字段处打断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 任何时候这个字段被修改都会暂停</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 排查数据被篡改，并发问题神器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">private</span> String sensitiveData;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"四、实战场景演练\"><a href=\"#四、实战场景演练\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、实战场景演练\"></a>四、实战场景演练</h1><p>场景：调试Feign调用超时问题。  </p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@FeignClient(name = &quot;user-service&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">UserFeignClient</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// 在方法上打方法断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"meta\">@GetMapping(&quot;/users/&#123;id&#125;&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tUser <span class=\"title function_\">getUser</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"meta\">@PathVariable</span> Long id)</span>; <span class=\"comment\">// 方法断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 条件断点排查特定用户</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"title function_\">processUser</span><span class=\"params\">(Long userId)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// Condition:userId.equals(123L)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"type\">User</span> <span class=\"variable\">user</span> <span class=\"operator\">=</span> userFeignClient.getUser(userId);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"五、进阶技巧\"><a href=\"#五、进阶技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"五、进阶技巧\"></a>五、进阶技巧</h1><p>1、日志断点：断点处直接打印日志，不用修改代码。<br>2、异常断点：特定异常自动暂停，排查bug超高效。<br>3、禁用断点：暂时关闭不删除，调试复杂问题超方便。  </p>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"一、条件断点\"><a href=\"#一、条件断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、条件断点\"></a>一、条件断点</h1><p>1、传统方式  </p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 在循环里疯狂下一步</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> (User user : userList) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// 低效！</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tSystem.out.println(user);</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"keyword\">if</span> (user.getName().equals(<span class=\"string\">&quot;目标用户&quot;</span>)) &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t\t<span class=\"comment\">// 业务逻辑</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>2、高级玩法：<code>右键断点-》设置条件（比如：user.getName().equals(&quot;目标用户&quot;)，它就会直接跳到满足条件的迭代）</code>。  </p>\n<h1 id=\"二、方法断点\"><a href=\"#二、方法断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、方法断点\"></a>二、方法断点</h1><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 在方法名上直接打断点，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 进入和退出都会暂停，超适合调试。</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@Transactional</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"title function_\">updateUser</span><span class=\"params\">(User user)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 在下面方法打断点，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 进入方法会暂停，</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t * 退出方法也会暂停</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">\t */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tuserMapper.save(user);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"三、字段断点\"><a href=\"#三、字段断点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、字段断点\"></a>三、字段断点</h1><figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 在下面字段处打断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">/**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 任何时候这个字段被修改都会暂停</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> * 排查数据被篡改，并发问题神器</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"> */</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">private</span> String sensitiveData;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"四、实战场景演练\"><a href=\"#四、实战场景演练\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、实战场景演练\"></a>四、实战场景演练</h1><p>场景：调试Feign调用超时问题。  </p>\n<figure class=\"highlight java\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">@FeignClient(name = &quot;user-service&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"title class_\">UserFeignClient</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// 在方法上打方法断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"meta\">@GetMapping(&quot;/users/&#123;id&#125;&quot;)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\tUser <span class=\"title function_\">getUser</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"meta\">@PathVariable</span> Long id)</span>; <span class=\"comment\">// 方法断点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\">// 条件断点排查特定用户</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">public</span> <span class=\"keyword\">void</span> <span class=\"title function_\">processUser</span><span class=\"params\">(Long userId)</span> &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"comment\">// Condition:userId.equals(123L)</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">\t<span class=\"type\">User</span> <span class=\"variable\">user</span> <span class=\"operator\">=</span> userFeignClient.getUser(userId);</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h1 id=\"五、进阶技巧\"><a href=\"#五、进阶技巧\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"五、进阶技巧\"></a>五、进阶技巧</h1><p>1、日志断点：断点处直接打印日志，不用修改代码。<br>2、异常断点：特定异常自动暂停，排查bug超高效。<br>3、禁用断点：暂时关闭不删除，调试复杂问题超方便。  </p>\n","categories":[{"name":"工作技能","path":"api/categories/工作技能.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"Idea bug调试方法","path":"api/tags/Idea bug调试方法.json"}]}